        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dappy, Costadinos Contostavlos, Tobias Sammet\n- Music Groups/Projects: N-Dubz, Avantasia, Edguy\n- Albums/Songs: Greatest Hits, No Regrets, Feva Las Vegas, We Dance On\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, rapper, actor, musician, music producer\n\nFacts:\n- Tobias Sammet was born on 21 November 1977.\n- Dappy, whose birth name is Costadinos Contostavlos, was born on 11 June 1987.\n- Tobias Sammet is a German musician, singer, songwriter, and music producer.\n- Tobias Sammet is best known as the founder of the rock opera project Avantasia and as the singer and primary songwriter of the heavy metal band Edguy.\n- Dappy is an English singer, songwriter, rapper, and actor.\n- The N-Dubz album Greatest Hits includes fourteen of the group's singles, excluding \"Feva Las Vegas\" and \"We Dance On.\"\n- Greatest Hits also includes one album track, two Live Lounge covers, and the original N-Dubz version of Dappy's first solo single, \"No Regrets.\"",
